{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41883","headline":"赠锺尊师游茅山 · 李中","name":"赠锺尊师游茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筇杖担琴背俗尘，路寻茅岭有谁群。\n仙翁物外应相遇，灵药壶中必许分。\n香入肌肤花洞酒，冷侵魂梦石牀云。\n伊予亦有朝修志，异日遨游愿见君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}